  source: 'Offline A* (8 neighbours) over the ''HiRISE Test Area'' heightfield: 513x513
    samples, 1.09 x 1.24 m cells, from the HiRISE 1 m DTM.

    Cost = 3D step length
    x (1 + 4 x (slope / 8 deg)^2). Never walks ground over 20 deg or within 10 m
    of the terrain edge.

    Avoids the 18 generated boulders (JezeroRockField seed
    2020, radius 80 m) by their radius + 1.5 m. Medium rocks and pebbles are not
    obstacles.

    Boulders are procedural placeholders, not mapped HiRISE rocks.
    Zigzags removed with straight-line shortcuts (<= 3% extra cost), then draped
    on the terrain every 1 m.

    Demo guidance only, not verified safe.'
